</section>
<section class="mx-[calc(50%-50vw)] bg-[#111] text-gray-200 pb-24">
  <style>
    .fd-wire line, .fd-wire rect, .fd-wire polyline, .fd-wire circle, .fd-wire path { vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }
    /* Mobile: show only the active graphic so the column matches its height
       (the stacked graphql panel is ~2.5x taller than the wireframes). */
    #foundry-accordion [data-acc-graphic][data-active="false"] { display: none; }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      /* Desktop: keep all graphics overlapping in one cell so the column
         reserves the tallest graphic's height and never reflows on switch. */
      #foundry-accordion [data-acc-graphic][data-active="false"] { display: block; visibility: hidden; }
      #foundry-accordion [data-acc-graphic][data-active="true"] { visibility: visible; }
    }
  </style>
  
  <div class="w-full max-w-site mx-auto px-[1lh]">
    <div class="pt-3.5 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.06em] tabular-nums text-white/50">
  Building your foundry website
</div>
    <div class="mt-20 mx-auto max-w-[920px] text-center text-[clamp(18px,2.4vw,28px)] leading-[1.35] text-balance text-white [&_p]:m-0 [&_a]:underline [&_a:hover]:opacity-70">
      
<p>Easy to launch without coding experience, and capable for advanced use-cases. You have several options to build your site, ranging in technical complexity and level of customizability.</p>

    </div>

    <div id="foundry-accordion" class="mt-28 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start">
      <div class="md:col-span-5">
        <div class="border-t border-white/15">
          <div data-acc-item="0" data-active="true" class="border-b border-white/15">
            <button type="button" data-acc-trigger class="w-full flex items-baseline gap-4 text-left py-4 cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-white/40 tabular-nums shrink-0 w-6">
                01
              </span>
              <span class="flex-1 text-[18px] leading-[1.25]">Start with the demo template</span>
              <span data-acc-icon class="font-mono text-white/40 shrink-0">
                −
              </span>
            </button>
            <div data-acc-body class="pb-5 pl-10 pr-4 ">
              <div class="m-0 text-white/55 leading-[1.55] max-w-[440px] [&_p]:m-0">
                
<p>Your Fontdue subscription comes with a basic template you can use to start selling fonts immediately. If you’re just testing things out this is a good place to start.</p>

              </div>
              <a href="/docs/reference/the-demo-template" class="!text-black inline-block mt-5 px-3.5 py-[7px] bg-lime hover:opacity-85 transition-opacity">
                Build with the template
              </a>
            </div>
          </div><div data-acc-item="1" data-active="false" class="border-b border-white/15">
            <button type="button" data-acc-trigger class="w-full flex items-baseline gap-4 text-left py-4 cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-white/40 tabular-nums shrink-0 w-6">
                02
              </span>
              <span class="flex-1 text-[18px] leading-[1.25]">Add components to your site</span>
              <span data-acc-icon class="font-mono text-white/40 shrink-0">
                +
              </span>
            </button>
            <div data-acc-body class="pb-5 pl-10 pr-4 hidden">
              <div class="m-0 text-white/55 leading-[1.55] max-w-[440px] [&_p]:m-0">
                
<p>Use low-code tools like Webflow or Framer to build your site. Drop in Fontdue components and you have a working foundry site.</p>

              </div>
              <a href="/docs/website/add-to-your-site" class="!text-black inline-block mt-5 px-3.5 py-[7px] bg-lime hover:opacity-85 transition-opacity">
                Add to any site
              </a>
            </div>
          </div><div data-acc-item="2" data-active="false" class="border-b border-white/15">
            <button type="button" data-acc-trigger class="w-full flex items-baseline gap-4 text-left py-4 cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-white/40 tabular-nums shrink-0 w-6">
                03
              </span>
              <span class="flex-1 text-[18px] leading-[1.25]">Build a custom site</span>
              <span data-acc-icon class="font-mono text-white/40 shrink-0">
                +
              </span>
            </button>
            <div data-acc-body class="pb-5 pl-10 pr-4 hidden">
              <div class="m-0 text-white/55 leading-[1.55] max-w-[440px] [&_p]:m-0">
                
<p>Fontdue is a headless CMS purpose-built for type foundry websites. The GraphQL API allows you to query all your Fontdue content, and extract information from fonts to power your website template. Import the React components and preload them with server-side rendering for the best user experience.</p>

              </div>
              <a href="/docs/develop/build" class="!text-black inline-block mt-5 px-3.5 py-[7px] bg-lime hover:opacity-85 transition-opacity">
                Read the docs
              </a>
            </div>
          </div><div data-acc-item="3" data-active="false" class="border-b border-white/15">
            <button type="button" data-acc-trigger class="w-full flex items-baseline gap-4 text-left py-4 cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-white/40 tabular-nums shrink-0 w-6">
                04
              </span>
              <span class="flex-1 text-[18px] leading-[1.25]">Have us build your site</span>
              <span data-acc-icon class="font-mono text-white/40 shrink-0">
                +
              </span>
            </button>
            <div data-acc-body class="pb-5 pl-10 pr-4 hidden">
              <div class="m-0 text-white/55 leading-[1.55] max-w-[440px] [&_p]:m-0">
                
<p>Want us to handle everything? We can build your site for you based on your Figma mockups.</p>

              </div>
              <a href="/services" class="!text-black inline-block mt-5 px-3.5 py-[7px] bg-lime hover:opacity-85 transition-opacity">
                Learn about services
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-7">
        
        <div class="grid">
          <div data-acc-graphic="0" data-active="true" class="col-start-1 row-start-1 min-w-0">
            <div class="rounded-[10px] overflow-hidden border bg-[#0a0a0a] border-white/10">
  <div class="px-3 py-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/10">
