</section>
<section id="pricing" class="px-[1lh] pb-20 scroll-mt-4">
  <div class="pt-3.5 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.06em] tabular-nums text-black/55 border-t border-black/20">
  Pricing
</div>
  <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start">
    <div class="md:col-span-5 text-sm [&_p]:m-0 [&_p:not(:first-child)]:mt-2.5 [&_p]:leading-[1.55] [&_p]:max-w-[420px] [&_a]:!text-black [&_a]:underline [&_a:hover]:opacity-60 [&>a:not(:first-child)]:mt-5">
      
<p>Every foundry pays the same: a monthly fee plus a percentage of each sale. This model keeps Fontdue independent and sustainable, and funds new features and daily email support.</p>

    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-7 ">
      
<div>
  <div class="[container-type:inline-size]">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-6 gap-y-2">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1 lg:flex-row lg:items-baseline lg:gap-2">
        <div class="text-[clamp(44px,18cqw,72px)] lg:text-[clamp(60px,13cqw,88px)] leading-[0.9] tabular-nums">$49</div>
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-black/55 uppercase tracking-[0.04em]">
          per month
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-[0.25em] text-[clamp(44px,18cqw,72px)] lg:text-[clamp(60px,13cqw,88px)] leading-[0.9]">
